@AGENTS.md

## Claude Code

- Load skills from `.agents/skills/` (project symlink) or `~/.agents/skills/` (global via `install-global.sh`).
- Use `grill-with-docs` before significant features.
- Use `tdd` for implementation; `diagnose` for hard bugs.
- Use `ship` to deploy; `retro` at cycle end.
- Prefer project docs (`CONTEXT.md`, `docs/agents/`) over auto memory for team facts.
- Setup status: `.ai-kit-setup`

## Cursor

Same skills and docs as Claude Code. Skills also live in `.cursor/skills/` (project) or `~/.cursor/skills/` (global).
The `ai-kit.mdc` rule loads this project's agent instructions.
